## ✅ Secure Google Integration

- Use Firebase Authentication with Google Sign-In (integrated in the chosen frontend framework)
- Only request OAuth scopes for Calendar, Tasks, and Photos
- Use HTTPS for all API calls
- Never hardcode credentials or tokens (use environment variables in the chosen frontend framework)
